========================================================================

  n=3 (V=2):
    T=4 = SL(2) + cross(2)
    E=1 (from F-matrix adjacency)
    D=1 = D_self(1) + D_cross(0)
    S_2=6 = S2_self(4) + S2_cross(2)
    excess_cross=0 (directed orbits beyond 2 per edge)

    E_naive = (T-D)/2 = 1  (WRONG?)
    E_correct = (T - SL - excess)/2 = 1
    E_formula2 = (3T-S2)/4 = 1
    actual E = 1
    Match naive: True, Match correct: True
    SL=2, D_self=1, SL-2*D_self=0
    SL + excess - D = 2 + 0 - 1 = 1 (should be 0 if E=(T-D)/2 worked)

  n=4 (V=4):
